                    "italic": false,
                    "text": " A chatbot can answer common questions instantly, day and night, such as the check-in time, the Wi-Fi password, and breakfast hours. That frees you to spend your time on the messages that really need a human touch. It sits naturally alongside a human team, handling the routine so people can handle the rest.",
